==English==

===Conjunction===
{{en-conj|pos=[[let]] [[alone]]}}

# {{idiom|negative polarity item}} [[much less|Much less]]; to say nothing of; {{non-gloss definition|used after negating one item, to introduce a further item whose negation is entailed by the negation of the first.}}
#: ''I didn't even notice it, '''let alone''' mind it.'' [=I didn't even notice it, so certainly I didn't mind it.]

